---
// 退款政策页：/refund/
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy" description="Our refund policy for membership subscriptions.">
  <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Effective 2026-10-08</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">1. Membership</h2>
  <p>We offer monthly, yearly, and lifetime membership tiers. Payment is processed by Stripe and PayPal.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">2. Refund conditions</h2>
  <p>Annual and lifetime plans may be refunded within 14 days of purchase if no premium content has been accessed. Monthly plans are billed monthly and are non-refundable after the billing period begins.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">3. Processing time</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds are processed within 5–10 business days to the original payment method.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">4. Lifetime membership</h2>
  <p>Lifetime access is a one-time purchase with no recurring charge. If the service is discontinued, we will provide notice as required by law.</p>
</BaseLayout>
